<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-TOUR OF CATALUNYA RESULT.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-TOUR OF CATALUNYA RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional result of</p>
<p>the Catalunya Rally on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza four hours 14 minutes</p>
<p>and 20 seconds</p>
<p>2. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza 7 secs behind</p>
<p>3. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth one minute 18</p>
<p>secs</p>
<p>4. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4  1:35</p>
<p>5. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer 1:52</p>
<p>6. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort   3:10</p>
<p>7. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza  3:41</p>
<p>8. Oriol Gomez (Spain) Renault Megane	  4:02</p>
<p>9. Rui Madeira (Portugal) Toyota Celica GT4  4:59</p>
<p>10.Andrea Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza   6:38</p>
<p>World Championship final standings</p>
<p>Drivers:</p>
<p> 1. Tommi Makinen (Finland)  123 points</p>
<p> 2. Colin McRae  (Britain)    92</p>
<p> 3. Carlos Sainz  (Spain)     89</p>
<p> 4. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) 78</p>
<p> 5. Piero Liatti (Italy)	56</p>
<p>Manufacturers</p>
<p> 1. Subaru			 401</p>
<p> 2. Mitsubishi		   322</p>
<p> 3. Ford			   299</p>
